 "about": "Contract v1.9 §12.4, v1.14 §12.4a: the admin policy both the MLS core (staged-commit check against group_meta.admins) and the server run. Users are symbolic (A, B, …); leaves are 'user/device'. leaves = the base epoch's leaf set (the epoch the commit is built in). adds/removes are the commit's proposals; meta is the group_meta change (admins = the new admin list, or null if unchanged). A non-admin may add leaves of its own user and of users already in leaves (never agents), and may remove another user's leaf only when the same commit re-adds that same device. Server-only checks (pending ops, the member_devices gate, liveness, caps) are not covered here.",
